    "product": {
      "id": 824478,
      "name": "Russet potatoes (CA)",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">A russet potato is&nbsp;a popular, large, starchy potato known for its rough, brown, netted skin and pale, white, fluffy flesh, making it ideal for baking (crispy skin, fluffy inside), mashing (absorbs butter/milk), and frying (crisp texture).&nbsp;Its high starch content and low moisture create a distinct dry, mealy texture when cooked, distinguishing it from waxier potatoes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grown by Genesis Organic Farm</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
